    81	      # the manifests appear in the tree — no workflow re-edit needed).
    82	      # `marketplace.json`'s schema is owned by build-plugin.py, so we
    83	      # assert on EVERY nested `version` field found rather than
    84	      # hardcoding one JSON path.
