  2129	#     framework source bytes at the SAME relpath, OR equals the recorded
  2130	#     target-manifest baseline digest for that rel (_baseline_lookup). A
  2130	#     target-manifest baseline digest for that rel (_baseline_lookup). A
  2131	#     byte-identical copy at a DIFFERENT relpath is NEVER authorized.
  2132	#     Neither match => keep + warn.
