   755	# PLAN-153 Wave B item B2 — upgrade operation journal (same shape as the
   756	# install-side journal): op<TAB>detail lines in a tempfile OUTSIDE $TARGET,
   757	# folded into .claude/.install-state.json by _write_upgrade_state at the end.
   758	# Dry-run never creates it. Fail-open throughout.
